{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#card-zh","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Optimizer 是面向 DSH Web 的提示词优化插件，在输入框模型选择器左侧添加✨按钮，并在设置页提供插件说明。它读取当前输入草稿和所选模型，通过 DSH 的模型服务将模糊需求改写为可执行提示词，再把结果填回输入框；优化时显示状态、锁定输入并呈现渐变边框。生成指令会按任务类型选择内容指令或 Agent 执行说明结构，强调先探索信息和可验证交付。插件还会对相同请求缓存结果并合并并发调用。需要 DSH Web 的模型选择器和可用模型服务，无需单独配置插件密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:109-156","lib/client.js:285-326","lib/index.js:25-75","lib/index.js:177-294"]}
{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#card-en","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Prompt Optimizer adds a button to the DSH Web composer that rewrites a rough draft into actionable instructions using the selected model. It shows progress, locks input during generation, and fills in the result.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:109-156","lib/client.js:285-326","lib/index.js:25-75","lib/index.js:177-294"]}
