{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#feature-1","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Optimizer 的功能「一键改写需求」：把输入框中的草稿交给当前选择的模型生成更清晰的提示词。点击模型选择器左侧的✨按钮触发，完成后将结果填回输入框。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:109-156","lib/index.js:223-261"]}
{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#feature-2","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Optimizer 的功能「优化状态反馈」：请求期间显示正在优化、完成或错误状态，并锁定输入框以免草稿被覆盖；成功结果仅在草稿版本未变化时回填。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:129-156","lib/client.js:186-199"]}
{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#feature-3","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Optimizer 的功能「按任务类型组织提示词」：模型根据内置规则为内容任务选择结构化指令模板，为需要动手执行的任务选择 Agent 执行说明书模板，并要求明确目标和验证标准。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-75"]}
{"unit_id":"xinmo114514__dsh-prompt-optimizer#feature-4","repo":"xinmo114514/dsh-prompt-optimizer","commit":"a5c514a1c53ed46035065f6fa546aa3f7acbb5af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Optimizer 的功能「复用请求结果」：宿主端按输入、provider、model 和推理等级缓存成功结果，并让相同的并发请求等待同一次模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:152-175","lib/index.js:203-221"]}
